# Where the map tile pyramid is served from. The directory it points at must
# contain tiles/<map>/<z>/<x>_<y>.webp — 27,306 files, 2.0 GB, which is why it
# is NOT in this repo or in public/.
#
# Production and dev both use the R2 bucket, pinned in .env.production and
# .env.development, so nothing needs setting to work on the site.
#
# For offline work only: put this in .env.local and run `npm run tiles`.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_BASE=http://localhost:8788
